     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div>Thanks for bringing this up. I haven&#39;t looked at your model, but this error message looks like a bug in Stan. I will try to hunt it down tomorrow. </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Daniel</div></div>"
    ],
    [
